{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.QMomentum","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QMomentum","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.QIntegerCanonical"],"declarations":13,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.p_q_eq_writhe","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.p_q_eq_writhe","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QMomentum.lean#L82-L87","doc":"**Owner-ruled canonical identity (2026-07-05):** for `q` with\n`q − q⁻¹ ≠ 0` (`M.q_reg`) the `q`-momentum equals the writhe — because\n`[±1]_q = ±1` exactly, each crossing contributes its sign with no residual\n`q`-dependence. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.qMomentum_aux","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.qMomentum_aux","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QMomentum.lean#L65-L80","doc":"Auxiliary: over a `±1` word, the `q`-bracket sum collapses to the integer\nsum, because `[±1]_q = ±1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QMomentum.writhe","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QMomentum.writhe","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QMomentum.lean#L60-L61","doc":"The classical writhe `w(β) = Σ_j ε_j`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QMomentum.p_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QMomentum.p_q","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QMomentum.lean#L56-L58","doc":"The `q`-momentum `p_q(β) = Σ_j [ε_j]_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QMomentum.signs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QMomentum.signs","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QMomentum.lean#L54-L54","doc":"Each crossing is `±1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QMomentum.crossings","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QMomentum.crossings","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QMomentum.lean#L52-L52","doc":"The signed crossing word `ε₁,…,ε_k` of the braid representative. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QMomentum.q_reg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QMomentum.q_reg","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QMomentum.lean#L50-L50","doc":"`q − q⁻¹ ≠ 0` (the `q`-bracket denominator is nonzero). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QMomentum.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QMomentum.q","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QMomentum.lean#L48-L48","doc":"Substrate parameter `q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QMomentum.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QMomentum.mk","kind":"ctor","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QMomentum.lean#L46-L46","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QMomentum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QMomentum","kind":"structure","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QMomentum.lean#L42-L54","doc":"Data for the `q`-momentum of a braid word.\n\nA `definition` carrier: the substrate `q` (with `q − q⁻¹ ≠ 0`) and the\ncrossing-sign word `crossings : List ℤ`, each entry `±1`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:q-momentum","label":"def:q-momentum","md":"quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-momentum.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.qBracket_neg_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.qBracket_neg_one","kind":"theorem","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QMomentum.lean#L35-L40","doc":"`[−1]_q = −1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.qBracket_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.qBracket_one","kind":"theorem","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QMomentum.lean#L30-L33","doc":"`[+1]_q = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.qBracket","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.qBracket","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QMomentum.lean#L26-L28","doc":"The `q`-integer `[e]_q = (q^e − q^{−e})/(q − q⁻¹)` for `e : ℤ`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}